                  Hey, I'm <span class=\"text-xl inline-block origin-bottom-right rotate-12\">👋</span>\n                    </p>\n                    <svg class=\"absolute -bottom-3 left-0 w-full h-3 text-black stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" fill=\"none\" style=\"stroke-width: 2px;\">\n                        <path d=\"M0 10 C 20 20, 40 0, 60 10 C 80 20, 100 5, 100 5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Masked Reveal Element: Main Title -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-[12vw] sm:text-8xl lg:text-[140px] font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-[0.85] uppercase text-[#1A1A1A] mb-8\">\n                <!-- Line 1: COLE -->\n                <div style=\"overflow: hidden; display: block; padding-bottom: 0.1em;\">\n                    <div class=\"gsap-mask-up flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-3\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">\n                        <span>C</span>\n                        <!-- Custom 'O' with Purple Circle and Star -->\n                        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-[0.85em] h-[0.85em] rounded-full bg-[#A79CFF] relative -translate-y-[0.05em] gsap-rotate-slow\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-linear\" class=\"text-black absolute w-1/2 h-1/2\" style=\"font-size: 0.5em; stroke-width: 2;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </span>\n                        <span>L</span>\n                        <span>E</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Line 2: MARTIN -->\n                <div style=\"overflow: hidden; display: block; padding-bottom: 0.1em; margin-top: -0.05em;\">\n                    <div class=\"gsap-mask-up flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">\n                        <span>M</span>\n                        <!-- Custom 'A' with Yellow styling -->\n                        <span class=\"text-[#F4B942] inline-block -translate-y-[0.1em] scale-110\">A</span>\n                        <span>R</span>\n                        <span>T</span>\n                        <span>I</span>\n                        <span class=\"lowercase text-[0.8em] -translate-y-[0.15em] mx-1\">n</span> <!-- lowercase n slightly smaller for quirky feel -->\n                        <span class=\"hidden sm:inline\"></span> <!-- spacer -->\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Masked Reveal Element: Pill & Desc -->\n            <div style=\"overflow: hidden; display: block; margin-bottom: 2rem;\">\n                <div class=\"gsap-mask-up flex items-center\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">\n                    <div class=\"border border-gray-300 rounded-full px-5 py-2 flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\" style=\"font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;\">Product Designer</span>\n                        <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-black flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" style=\"font-size: 14px; stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Masked Reveal Element: Description -->\n            <div style=\"overflow: hidden; display: block; margin-bottom: 3rem; max-w-md;\">\n                <div class=\"gsap-mask-up\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">\n                    <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-600 font-semibold\" style=\"font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;\">\n                        I craft intuitive digital experiences that are user-friendly, purposeful, and visually engaging.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Masked Reveal Element: CTA Group -->\n            <div style=\"overflow: hidden; display: block;\">\n                <div class=\"gsap-mask-up flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8\" style=\"transform: translateY(110%);\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-[#1A1A1A] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-gray-800 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;\">\n                        View my work\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" style=\"font-size: 16px; stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </a>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-1 text-gray-500\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\" style=\"font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;\">Scroll to explore</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-down-linear\" class=\"gsap-bounce-y\" style=\"font-size: 16px; stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Column: Abstract Image Composition -->\n        <div class=\"col-span-1 lg:col-span-6 relative w-full h-[500px] lg:h-[700px] flex items-center justify-center mt-12 lg:mt-0 z-0\">\n            \n            <!-- Soft Gradient Background (Simulating WebGL blob) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#A79CFF]/20 via-[#F9F8F5] to-[#F4B942]/20 rounded-full blur-3xl scale-110 opacity-70\"></div>\n            \n            <!-- Main Image Blob Container -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-[85%] sm:w-[70%] max-w-[450px] aspect-[4/5] z-10 gsap-float\" style=\"border-radius: 45% 55% 70% 30% / 40% 60% 40% 60%; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Portrait of Cole\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-center scale-105\" />\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Badge: Solving Problems (Purple Circle) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[10%] left-[5%] lg:-left-[10%] w-[140px] h-[140px] z-20 gsap-float-delayed\">\n                <!-- SVG Text Circle -->\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" class=\"w-full h-full text-black fill-current gsap-rotate-slow\">\n                    <!-- The circle path is slightly smaller than viewport to avoid clipping -->\n                    <path id=\"textPath-circle\" d=\"M 50, 50 m -35, 0 a 35,35 0 1,1 70,0 a 35,35 0 1,1 -70,0\" fill=\"#A79CFF\" stroke=\"none\" />\n                    <text class=\"text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold tracking-widest\" style=\"font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;\">\n                        <textPath href=\"#textPath-circle\" startOffset=\"0%\">\n                            Solving Problems • Designing Solutions •\n                        </textPath>\n                    </text>\n                    <!-- Center Star Icon -->\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#A79CFF\" />\n                    <g transform=\"translate(42, 42) scale(0.65)\">\n                        <path d=\"M12 0L14.59 9.41L24 12L14.59 14.59L12 24L9.41 14.59L0 12L9.41 9.41L12 0Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                    </g>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Badge: Available for New Projects (Orange Blob) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[5%] right-[0%] lg:-right-[5%] w-[160px] h-[140px] bg-[#F4B942] z-20 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 text-center rotate-6 gsap-float\" style=\"border-radius: 70% 30% 60% 40% / 50% 60% 40% 50%;\">\n                <div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-2\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-6 bg-black rounded-full rotate-[-20deg]\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-8 bg-black rounded-full\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-6 bg-black rounded-full rotate-[20deg]\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase leading-tight text-black\" style=\"font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;\">Available for<br>new projects</span>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-1 mt-2\">\n                    <span class=\"w-3 h-1 bg-black rounded-full rotate-[-45deg]\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"w-3 h-1 bg-black rounded-full rotate-[-45deg] -translate-y-1\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"w-3 h-1 bg-black rounded-full rotate-[-45deg] -translate-y-2\"></span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Badge: Location Pill (Green) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[10%] left-[10%] lg:left-[0%] bg-[#88C999] px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3 z-20 rotate-[-4deg] gsap-float-delayed\" style=\"border-radius: 30px 10px 30px 30px;\">\n                <div class=\"bg-black/10 p-1.5 rounded-full\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-point-linear\" class=\"text-black\" style=\"font-size: 18px; stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col text-black\" style=\"font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase opacity-70\">Based in</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">Chicago, IL</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Decorative Elements -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[5%] right-[10%] lg:right-[5%] text-[#F279A6] z-10 gsap-rotate-slow-reverse\">\n                <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                    <path d=\"M30 0L33.5 26.5L60 30L33.5 33.5L30 60L26.5 33.5L0 30L26.5 26.5L30 0Z\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[5%] left-[20%] text-black z-0 opacity-40\">\n                 <svg width=\"120\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n                    <path d=\"M5 20 C 15 5, 25 35, 35 20 C 45 5, 55 35, 65 20 C 75 5, 85 35, 95 20 C 105 5, 115 35, 115 20\" />\n                 </svg>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Dotted grid background subtle overlay -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[10%] right-[20%] w-32 h-32 opacity-10 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #000 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 10px 10px;\"></div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Features Banner -->\n    <section class=\"relative z-20 max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 pb-24 -mt-12 lg:-mt-24\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-6 lg:p-8 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] border border-gray-100\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row flex-wrap lg:flex-nowrap items-center justify-between gap-8 lg:gap-4\">\n                \n                <!-- Feature 1 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 w-full md:w-auto lg:w-1/5 md:border-r border-gray-100 last:border-0 md:pr-4\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center bg-[#F279A6]/10 text-[#F279A6]\">\n                         <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:flower-linear\" style=\"font-size: 24px; stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 tracking-wide\" style=\"font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;\">\n                        User-Centered<br>Design\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Feature 2 -